# JKUBIN | Description: Pythagorean tree
# JKUBIN | Variables: {A}
# JKUBIN | P: {
# JKUBIN | 	ω → F+++F+++F+++A
# JKUBIN | 	A → [----->>F+++A+++F+++F]F[----->F+++F+++A+++F]
# JKUBIN | 	A → F
# JKUBIN | }
# JKUBIN | n = 1, δ = 30°, scale = 0.707106781
